WEBVTT

00:00.360 --> 00:01.230
#3 MY WIFE

00:01.230 --> 00:02.730
#3 MY WIFE
Say...

00:02.730 --> 00:04.470
#3 MY WIFE
Do you really have to finish that book tonight?

00:04.470 --> 00:07.480
Do you really have to finish that book tonight?

00:07.480 --> 00:09.490
Not really.

00:09.490 --> 00:10.490
What's up?

00:10.800 --> 00:13.670
Well, actually...

00:13.670 --> 00:17.620
I found an interesting movie for rental,
so I rented it...

00:17.620 --> 00:20.310
Want use the TV?
Let me get out of your hair...

00:20.310 --> 00:23.250
Oh, no! You can stay!

00:24.890 --> 00:27.650
So, um...

00:27.650 --> 00:28.380
It's this one!

00:28.380 --> 00:29.160
CHASE! 24 HOURS WITH KITTENS ~NO CUT EDITION~

00:29.160 --> 00:32.140
CHASE! 24 HOURS WITH KITTENS ~NO CUT EDITION~
Do you want to watch this with me?

00:32.770 --> 00:36.650
It's not actually gonna run
for 24 hours straight, is it?

00:36.650 --> 00:37.860
Of course it is, meow!

00:37.860 --> 00:40.020
And it's 100 yen too,
so talk about a great deal!

00:40.020 --> 00:42.020
1440 minutes...

00:42.020 --> 00:45.470
Oh, looks like it's got
the Best Selection version too.

00:45.470 --> 00:47.710
A collection of highlights for 3 hours.

00:47.710 --> 00:49.220
Let's watch that one, please!

01:00.840 --> 01:02.720
That was fun!

01:02.720 --> 01:05.840
Let's watch the 24 hour version
next time, okay!

01:07.030 --> 01:08.990
Where are we?! Alpha Centauri?!

01:08.990 --> 01:09.970
No, we're on Earth.

01:10.320 --> 01:11.970
You okay?

01:12.380 --> 01:14.980
Since you watched
my favourite movie with me,

01:14.980 --> 01:17.520
now it's my turn to watch yours together.

01:17.520 --> 01:19.560
I'm more into games than movies.

01:19.560 --> 01:22.600
I've rarely played video games before...

01:22.940 --> 01:24.880
You might actually get addicted to it!

01:24.880 --> 01:26.410
I'll show you how to play!

01:26.410 --> 01:30.740
Even if the world turns upside down,
no way I'd get addicted to video games.

01:32.240 --> 01:33.700
I did it!

01:33.700 --> 01:34.620
You win!

01:35.360 --> 01:39.480
I can't believe I got to spend some fun
time together with my long time nemesis.

01:51.600 --> 01:52.680
Thanks for today...

01:52.680 --> 01:54.660
Oh, you were awake?

01:54.660 --> 01:56.860
Yeah, since a few minutes ago.

01:56.860 --> 01:58.090
I see.

01:58.090 --> 02:01.480
We can go buy your
favourite games next time.

02:02.000 --> 02:04.100
I'll find my favourite movies too.

02:04.500 --> 02:05.750
Don't call me "you".

02:05.750 --> 02:06.360
Huh?

02:06.720 --> 02:10.630
It feels like you're looking
down on me if you do.

02:10.630 --> 02:12.240
Call me by my name.

02:12.640 --> 02:14.010
Sakuramori?

02:14.010 --> 02:15.740
Not my surname...

02:15.740 --> 02:17.720
Then, Akane...

02:18.490 --> 02:20.560
What is it, Saito?

02:21.800 --> 02:22.990
Never mind.

02:23.650 --> 02:24.500
Okay.

02:32.380 --> 02:33.760
I'M GETTING MARRIED TO A GIRL

02:33.760 --> 02:35.340
I HATE IN MY CLASS

02:35.340 --> 02:38.350
I'M GETTING MARRIED TO A GIRL
I HATE IN MY CLASS

03:53.250 --> 03:58.010
I'M GETTING MARRIED TO A GIRL
I HATE IN MY CLASS

04:03.560 --> 04:04.830
You dropped this.

04:06.150 --> 04:08.020
Oh, thanks.

04:09.120 --> 04:12.070
Did you have an argument with Saito again?

04:12.070 --> 04:14.030
We always do.

04:14.030 --> 04:17.830
It doesn't seem like the usual shenanigans.

04:17.830 --> 04:22.260
You don't bicker at him so much,
so I guess you started hating talking to him...

04:22.260 --> 04:25.540
It's nothing like that, though...

04:25.900 --> 04:27.040
So you got along now?

04:27.040 --> 04:29.720
A-As if that would ever
happen with Saito!

04:29.720 --> 04:33.630
Wait, did you always
call him by his name?

04:33.630 --> 04:35.550
Wa— Uh...

04:35.550 --> 04:38.270
I'm going home now!
See you tomorrow!

04:38.270 --> 04:41.970
Akane! We're not even done
with our first period!

04:41.970 --> 04:43.890
LIBRARY

04:43.890 --> 04:45.260
This is it.

04:48.090 --> 04:49.640
Guess who.

04:50.080 --> 04:53.020
Only Shisei would do such a prank to me.

04:53.750 --> 04:56.780
Wow, Cousin.
You understand me well.

04:56.780 --> 04:58.840
I do not.

04:58.840 --> 05:01.780
I cannot fathom why you would do this.

05:01.780 --> 05:05.100
I wanted to fix your dry eyes.

05:05.100 --> 05:06.540
SMUG
How kind of me.

05:06.540 --> 05:07.190
COMMUNICATION SKILLS FROM ZERO

05:07.190 --> 05:09.670
COMMUNICATION SKILLS FROM ZERO
I didn't expect you to be concerned about

05:09.670 --> 05:11.290
COMMUNICATION SKILLS FROM ZERO
your lack of communication skills.

05:11.290 --> 05:12.440
Wonder why?

05:13.790 --> 05:18.030
I just thought I could better
my relationship with Akane...

05:18.030 --> 05:19.920
Was it useful?

05:20.290 --> 05:21.290
Yeah.

05:21.290 --> 05:25.960
It says solidarity with others can
be enhanced through collaboration.

05:27.550 --> 05:28.720
Got a minute?

05:29.180 --> 05:32.310
What?! I told you not to
talk to me at school!

05:32.310 --> 05:33.810
Well...

05:34.160 --> 05:36.250
Are you busy after school?

05:36.250 --> 05:39.540
I am. I must study hard at home.

05:39.540 --> 05:41.000
That's not what I mean...

05:41.000 --> 05:43.760
You don't have plans
to hang out with your friends?

05:43.760 --> 05:46.860
Huh? Well, no...

05:46.860 --> 05:51.710
Then, what say we meet up and go
shopping together after school?

05:53.480 --> 05:55.210
D-Does that mean...

05:55.210 --> 05:56.710
A da...

06:00.720 --> 06:04.610
You pervert! How dare you drag a girl to
a dark place and do violent stuff to her!

06:04.610 --> 06:06.850
It's all because you said the D-word!

06:07.510 --> 06:09.660
But is it not?

06:09.660 --> 06:12.600
A boy and a girl meeting up...

06:12.900 --> 06:14.850
I-It's not a date...

06:14.850 --> 06:16.300
It's shopping!

06:16.300 --> 06:18.980
Wouldn't it be a hassle
to carry the bags alone?!

06:18.980 --> 06:20.940
Oh, yeah! It's shopping!

06:20.940 --> 06:24.580
Right, no way you'd
invite me to a date, huh!

06:24.580 --> 06:27.260
Of course!
Don't you get the wrong idea!

06:27.260 --> 06:31.240
I'm not! But don't you get
the wrong idea either!

06:36.200 --> 06:38.730
Where do we meet up?

06:43.010 --> 06:44.760
Akane!

06:44.760 --> 06:46.520
Let's go home together!

06:46.520 --> 06:48.510
Himari?! Weren't you supposed to be working?!

06:49.110 --> 06:52.360
Oh, my shift got cancelled out of the blue.

06:52.360 --> 06:55.250
I wanted to hang out with you,
so this is just perfect.

06:55.250 --> 06:56.900
R-Really...

06:56.900 --> 07:00.230
Speaking of, that parfait shop you frequent...

07:00.230 --> 07:02.880
It's selling a limited menu
from evening today!

07:02.880 --> 07:05.780
Really?! That big portion
1 kg strawberry parfait!

07:05.780 --> 07:09.560
Yep, yep! You've been wanting
to have a bite, right?

07:09.560 --> 07:11.320
Let me treat you!

07:12.260 --> 07:15.780
Um, sorry, but I already have
a plan with someone...

07:15.780 --> 07:19.430
Who's that? Your new friend?
Let me say hi!

07:19.430 --> 07:21.170
You know the guy...

07:21.170 --> 07:24.750
The only one I know
who's close to you...

07:24.750 --> 07:27.770
That'd be Saito...

07:28.360 --> 07:29.600
Is this a date?

07:29.600 --> 07:30.930
It's not!

07:31.440 --> 07:34.920
Oh, well! We should hang out together, then!

07:34.920 --> 07:37.120
I'd love to get to know
your new friend too!

07:37.120 --> 07:38.440
I'm really sorry!

07:38.440 --> 07:40.690
I'll have to pass today!
Maybe next time!

07:41.690 --> 07:42.540
Eep!

07:42.540 --> 07:44.190
Owwie!

07:44.510 --> 07:47.790
I'm sorry! Are you okay?!
Why are you lying on the floor?!

07:47.790 --> 07:50.570
I've been waiting for you, Akane.
To catch you in my trap.

07:51.000 --> 07:53.480
But the trap is damaged instead...

07:53.480 --> 07:57.080
I can't believe there's a person brave enough
to stand up after stepping on me...

07:57.080 --> 08:01.460
To reward your bravery and valour,
I shall present you the legendary sword.

08:01.460 --> 08:03.870
I'm in a rush now,
so could you let me go?

08:03.870 --> 08:06.120
Before that, I have a question for you.

08:06.120 --> 08:09.710
What doth thou wish
to have a collaboration in?

08:09.710 --> 08:10.850
Collaboration?

08:10.850 --> 08:12.180
Here's a questionnaire.

08:12.470 --> 08:15.520
What do you want to collaborate
with my cousin in?

08:15.520 --> 08:17.630
Why did you bring your cousin up?

08:17.630 --> 08:20.340
No particular reason.
I just want to ask.

08:20.340 --> 08:24.110
Unless you answer me,
I'm not letting you go.

08:24.110 --> 08:27.560
Sorry, but I have important business now!

08:27.560 --> 08:28.330
Ah...

08:30.590 --> 08:33.870
Why did I say important business...

08:34.170 --> 08:35.870
It's not a date at all.

08:35.870 --> 08:36.760
This is housework.

08:36.760 --> 08:39.170
We're just buying daily necessities together.

08:39.170 --> 08:40.280
Thanks for waiting.

08:41.390 --> 08:42.870
R-Right...

08:45.980 --> 08:47.880
Where are we going?

08:48.250 --> 08:51.750
There's a store I frequent near our home.

08:52.190 --> 08:53.190
I see.

08:53.620 --> 08:54.480
Yeah.

08:54.890 --> 08:57.390
NEKOOKA - OPEN UNTIL 11 PM

08:57.390 --> 08:57.800
EGG KING

08:57.800 --> 08:59.990
EGG KING
For now, what we've run out at home...

08:59.990 --> 09:02.520
EGG KING
...are green onions, natto, and eggs...

09:03.760 --> 09:06.420
Don't just put random stuff in!
Look at the price!

09:06.420 --> 09:07.280
Price?

09:07.590 --> 09:10.150
It's 20 yen more expensive
than this one, right?

09:10.150 --> 09:13.380
Eggs are so cheap,
they're dubbed the "model price of food",

09:13.380 --> 09:15.400
the strongest allies to family budget.

09:15.400 --> 09:18.240
It's a waste to buy
the expensive ones on purpose.

09:18.240 --> 09:19.410
Okay.

09:25.420 --> 09:27.050
LIMITED TIME SALE
CHICKEN BREAST 50 YEN A PACK

09:27.050 --> 09:28.670
Oh? Huh?

09:29.010 --> 09:30.240
What?!

09:45.240 --> 09:47.300
We've still got a long way to go...

09:47.300 --> 09:50.040
What are we doing...

09:55.000 --> 09:57.250
I guess we just have
to accept defeat today.

09:57.630 --> 09:59.240
Let's win this next time.

09:59.240 --> 10:00.790
We're still doing this?

10:00.790 --> 10:02.410
Of course.

10:02.410 --> 10:04.540
It's survival of the fittest in this world.

10:04.540 --> 10:06.220
I'll pass.

10:06.220 --> 10:07.230
No.

10:07.550 --> 10:09.800
You're coming with me.

10:10.110 --> 10:11.570
O-Okay...

10:13.810 --> 10:15.800
You're a diligent one, aren't you?

10:15.800 --> 10:17.810
You must mean
to say I'm annoying, right?

10:17.810 --> 10:19.540
No, it's not that.

10:19.540 --> 10:21.680
I'm just saying you'll make a great wife.

10:21.680 --> 10:23.310
Huh? What?!

10:25.810 --> 10:28.260
But I'm already married...

10:28.260 --> 10:30.570
Oh, right...

10:44.840 --> 10:46.830
You were trying to assault me, right?!

10:46.830 --> 10:47.590
Wha...

10:47.590 --> 10:49.480
You're the one who clung to me, Akane!

10:49.480 --> 10:51.510
As if I'd do that!

10:51.510 --> 10:54.200
Did you know?
I was staying still so you wouldn't wake up!

10:54.200 --> 10:57.880
Yeah, right! Weren't you trying
to pierce my cheeks with your claws?!

10:57.880 --> 10:59.720
I wouldn't do something so graphic!

10:59.720 --> 11:01.600
What, then?!

11:05.370 --> 11:08.570
I was fascinated by
your cute sleeping face.

11:08.570 --> 11:11.790
So, I impulsively wanted to
pinch your cheek...

11:11.790 --> 11:12.740
Sorry.

11:12.740 --> 11:13.880
What?!

11:14.360 --> 11:16.660
I-Is that true?

11:16.660 --> 11:17.520
Yeah.

11:17.520 --> 11:20.240
H-How cute?

11:20.240 --> 11:23.370
So much that I almost lost my cool...

11:27.930 --> 11:29.860
You can do it... for a while.

11:29.860 --> 11:30.500
Huh?

11:35.300 --> 11:37.010
My sleeping face.

11:37.530 --> 11:40.760
I'm saying you can look at it
for a while.

12:05.040 --> 12:06.790
M-Morning.

12:07.130 --> 12:09.160
Yeah, morning...

12:15.390 --> 12:16.300
What's wrong?!

12:16.300 --> 12:18.970
I was spacing out,
and overcooked the bread...

12:18.970 --> 12:20.800
This is beyond overcooked!

12:21.230 --> 12:23.800
What's wrong with you,
so early in the morning?

12:23.800 --> 12:26.430
Why are you not wearing anything?!

12:26.430 --> 12:27.840
What are you on about?

12:27.840 --> 12:30.920
No way I'd go around the house naked...

12:30.920 --> 12:33.260
STRAWBERRY CREAM BREAD

12:33.260 --> 12:35.320
NEW ON SALE!

12:37.320 --> 12:38.910
Here, I bought it.

12:38.910 --> 12:40.860
Huh? It's this big?

12:40.860 --> 12:41.950
I can't eat this much...

12:42.340 --> 12:43.920
Let's split it, then.

12:44.290 --> 12:45.700
Split...

12:46.550 --> 12:49.210
Oh? Saito and Akane?

12:49.950 --> 12:53.310
It's rare to see you together
outside school.

12:53.310 --> 12:55.840
Are you going to school together?
How come?

12:56.450 --> 12:58.510
No way we'd do that together.

12:58.510 --> 13:01.900
Man, Saito's just stalking me!

13:01.900 --> 13:03.560
Call the police right now!

13:03.560 --> 13:04.710
Hold it right there!

13:04.710 --> 13:08.570
You look like you're having fun chatting with
each other, and you're sharing bread too.

13:08.570 --> 13:11.240
He just took the leftover
I threw away to the pavement,

13:11.240 --> 13:13.660
since I couldn't eat the whole thing!

13:13.660 --> 13:14.460
Saito?

13:14.460 --> 13:15.520
I'm not a dog!

13:15.520 --> 13:18.900
No, you're not a dog, sure!
You're a person who'd do this!

13:18.900 --> 13:22.340
Every time I throw something to the street,
you'd just grab it greedily!

13:22.340 --> 13:24.280
I'll sue you for defamation!

13:24.280 --> 13:24.910
Hey!

13:24.910 --> 13:25.520
Ouch!

13:25.520 --> 13:28.000
Don't throw away food to the street.

13:28.000 --> 13:28.910
I'm sorry...

13:28.910 --> 13:30.290
That's your concern?!

13:31.920 --> 13:34.920
Are you still studying?
It's already late.

13:34.920 --> 13:37.010
We're having a quiz soon.

13:37.010 --> 13:39.300
Oh, you don't have to study for that.

13:39.300 --> 13:42.680
You scored 100 on the previous quiz, huh?

13:42.680 --> 13:44.300
You sure you don't want to study?

13:44.300 --> 13:46.280
I never study for exams.

13:46.280 --> 13:49.750
I remember everything taught in class.
It's harder for me to forget it instead.

13:49.750 --> 13:53.270
So, you're meaning to say that
I'm stupid for studying hard, is that it?!

13:53.270 --> 13:55.020
I'm not.

13:55.020 --> 13:56.280
Still, you have it hard, huh.

13:56.730 --> 13:58.180
Get out!

13:58.940 --> 14:00.490
Don't disturb me!

14:03.700 --> 14:05.220
What do you want?

14:05.220 --> 14:07.170
I made you dinner.

14:07.170 --> 14:09.050
Why don't you eat it while studying?

14:09.050 --> 14:10.450
Dinner?

14:12.100 --> 14:13.910
Strawberry sandwiches?!

14:13.910 --> 14:14.880
Here you go.

14:16.680 --> 14:19.840
Why would he make
something like this for me?

14:20.260 --> 14:22.340
What's his scheme here?

14:23.040 --> 14:27.350
I-I suppose I could taste it...

14:30.170 --> 14:31.320
So good...

14:33.240 --> 14:36.860
I won't hold back with the quiz
if I eat this, then!

14:37.290 --> 14:39.450
I'll do my best till morning!

15:00.920 --> 15:02.880
Akane? You okay?

15:03.250 --> 15:05.550
Yeah, I just fell asleep.

15:05.550 --> 15:07.640
You can't sleep while walking.

15:07.640 --> 15:10.600
You've been swaying
these days while walking.

15:10.600 --> 15:12.150
You sure you're okay?

15:12.150 --> 15:14.770
I just haven't got enough sleep
from studying.

15:14.770 --> 15:18.100
Keep it in moderation, okay?
You'll ruin yourself.

15:18.760 --> 15:21.780
Even if my body turns to dust,

15:21.780 --> 15:24.560
as long as I'm the top scorer
of our year, I'm fine with it.

15:24.560 --> 15:27.400
Forget your scores,
your health comes first.

15:27.400 --> 15:30.560
You won't be able to beat
Saito this time too, either way.

15:31.160 --> 15:33.130
I won't be able to beat Saito?

15:33.910 --> 15:36.220
I'll definitely win against Saito!

15:36.220 --> 15:39.070
Even if it takes centuries,
I'll make him tremble in tatters,

15:39.070 --> 15:41.550
and make him admit that I'm superior!

15:41.850 --> 15:45.940
Centuries? But wouldn't
you have graduated by then?

15:45.940 --> 15:48.150
We only have a year in high school, too.

15:48.150 --> 15:51.810
If you can't win, are you going
to chase him to the same uni?

15:51.810 --> 15:53.230
No way!

15:53.230 --> 15:56.310
If I do that,
it'll look like I have a crush on him!

15:58.810 --> 16:00.810
I brought you dinner.

16:02.530 --> 16:04.140
Are you sleeping?

16:04.140 --> 16:05.820
You should sleep in bed...

16:06.840 --> 16:08.160
Feeling sick?

16:08.160 --> 16:11.180
Not at all...

16:11.180 --> 16:13.330
I'm just taking a short break.

16:14.380 --> 16:15.890
Quite a fever...

16:16.640 --> 16:18.040
Just go to bed now.

16:18.040 --> 16:19.710
Okay.

16:22.960 --> 16:25.720
I'm sweating a lot,
it's so uncomfortable...

16:25.720 --> 16:26.970
Wait there.

16:36.740 --> 16:37.730
No...

16:38.170 --> 16:39.260
You can't touch there...

16:39.980 --> 16:40.880
Sorry.

16:43.560 --> 16:46.740
I... must study.

16:46.740 --> 16:48.750
That's what made you collapse.

16:49.120 --> 16:50.640
Don't force yourself.

16:50.640 --> 16:54.590
I have a dream I want to achieve,
even by forcing myself.

16:54.590 --> 16:55.370
Dream?

16:55.370 --> 16:59.040
I... want to be a doctor.

16:59.040 --> 17:04.120
I want to be someone who can
save people who are suffering.

17:04.120 --> 17:06.850
I will hate myself if I'm so powerless.

17:07.380 --> 17:11.890
I want the people I love
to always stay healthy.

17:12.300 --> 17:17.470
But... Our family doesn't have the privilege
to send me to a medical school.

17:17.470 --> 17:22.650
If I marry you, Grandma said
she'll pay for all my tuition.

17:22.920 --> 17:24.200
So...

17:24.200 --> 17:25.650
I see.

17:25.960 --> 17:27.740
You sure have it easy, huh...

17:27.740 --> 17:30.400
You can get good scores
without even trying.

17:30.870 --> 17:33.500
No matter how hard I study,
I can't beat you.

17:33.500 --> 17:35.710
I couldn't help but feel frustrated.

17:36.200 --> 17:38.660
Talent varies from person to person.
It is what it is.

17:38.660 --> 17:40.830
That's what I hate about you.

17:42.320 --> 17:44.710
And that's why I kind of look up to you...

17:44.710 --> 17:45.710
Look up?

17:48.710 --> 17:51.290
Forget it!
I don't look up to you at all!

17:51.290 --> 17:53.090
I hate you so much!

17:57.100 --> 17:59.560
COLD BARRIER EX
Is the antipyretic working?

17:59.560 --> 18:00.600
COLD BARRIER EX
I don't know...

18:02.610 --> 18:04.910
Maybe we should call an ambulance.

18:04.910 --> 18:07.110
No, please...
Don't make a fuss out of this.

18:07.610 --> 18:10.310
An ambulance should be reserved
for someone more critical.

18:10.310 --> 18:14.220
A fever above 40 degrees Celcius
can't be a mere cold.

18:14.220 --> 18:16.240
If you want to be a doctor,
you should know.

18:16.700 --> 18:20.120
What if someone with a terminal illness
passes away because I'm in the ambulance?

18:20.120 --> 18:21.750
I won't forgive myself if that happens!

18:22.070 --> 18:23.210
Hey, now...

18:26.280 --> 18:28.750
Damn, no taxis either, huh...

18:28.750 --> 18:30.880
Just go to sleep.

18:30.880 --> 18:32.630
We have school tomorrow.

18:32.630 --> 18:33.640
Not happening.

18:36.660 --> 18:38.390
What are you doing?

18:38.390 --> 18:40.660
I can't just turn a blind eye...

18:40.660 --> 18:41.890
...when my wife is in pain.

18:42.730 --> 18:44.140
Wife...?

18:58.780 --> 19:01.100
You're surprisingly strong, huh...

19:01.670 --> 19:04.410
This is the first time I heard
about your dream.

19:04.410 --> 19:07.360
I bet you're going to ridicule me
for such an impossible dream...

19:07.360 --> 19:10.120
As if. You can become one.

19:10.120 --> 19:11.920
Why...?

19:11.920 --> 19:14.420
You'll pull through anything
no matter what, right?

19:14.420 --> 19:17.200
Well... yeah.

19:17.200 --> 19:20.160
I'm bad at giving up.

19:28.830 --> 19:31.120
I got married to a girl I hate most.

19:31.960 --> 19:34.840
It was an unfortunate happening...

19:35.780 --> 19:38.050
But I'm sure this marriage...

19:39.960 --> 19:41.970
...will have a happy ending someday.

19:49.360 --> 19:52.070
How long are you gonna sleep?
Rise and shine.

19:52.070 --> 19:54.970
I know, I know...

19:54.970 --> 19:56.720
You'll be late for school.

19:57.090 --> 20:00.570
Oh, well.
I'll skip school for a month, then.

20:01.100 --> 20:02.700
If you don't wake up now,

20:02.700 --> 20:06.230
I'll wake you up with the pan
I just used to fry the eggs.

20:09.460 --> 20:10.490
Morning.

20:11.860 --> 20:12.920
You demon.

20:12.920 --> 20:16.070
Oh? I came all the way to wake you up,
and that's how you thank me?

20:16.560 --> 20:18.320
Come on, say thank you properly.

20:18.320 --> 20:19.560
Thank you.

20:19.560 --> 20:21.320
Not "very much"?

20:21.320 --> 20:23.330
Thank you very much!

20:23.330 --> 20:24.530
Great!

20:25.560 --> 20:28.440
In the end, it was a mere fever.

20:28.980 --> 20:32.280
She's back to normal after a week.

20:32.590 --> 20:35.250
You didn't wash your face
before school yesterday, right?

20:35.250 --> 20:37.860
It was raining,
so my face would get wet, anyway.

20:37.860 --> 20:39.190
What are you, a primitive man?!

20:39.190 --> 20:41.680
It's only natural for a human
to wash their face!

20:41.680 --> 20:45.220
All you're ever good at is studying,
and nothing else, huh!

20:45.220 --> 20:47.670
You sure you want to
talk like that to me?

20:48.350 --> 20:50.850
Huh? What are you getting smug for?

20:50.850 --> 20:53.980
You said you "look up" to me?

20:55.730 --> 20:58.190
I-I blurted that out because of the fever!

20:58.190 --> 21:00.220
I got it recorded on my phone!

21:00.740 --> 21:04.120
I'll sink you and your phone into lava!

21:05.400 --> 21:07.200
Morning, Saito.

21:07.200 --> 21:08.120
Morning.

21:08.440 --> 21:12.020
So you got 100 for the quiz yesterday, huh?

21:12.020 --> 21:13.630
Mad respect, man.

21:13.630 --> 21:16.380
Yeah, respect me.
Worship me.

21:17.250 --> 21:19.250
You sure are a strange one, huh?

21:19.250 --> 21:20.180
Strange?

21:20.180 --> 21:23.760
You're good at studying,
but you don't know anything...

21:24.990 --> 21:26.640
So slow on the uptake, aren't you?

21:26.970 --> 21:28.200
Don't get too close to me.

21:28.200 --> 21:30.790
What? Getting flustered here?

21:30.790 --> 21:31.520
I'm not.

21:34.220 --> 21:38.530
I'm kidding! You're a boy, after all.

21:38.530 --> 21:40.490
HUFF...

21:44.030 --> 21:45.450
Wh-What's up?

21:46.030 --> 21:50.570
You can't get too close with another girl
when you have a wife...

21:50.570 --> 21:52.060
I won't allow it, okay?

21:56.050 --> 22:00.220
Recently, my wife is looking
so cute to me...

23:35.060 --> 23:40.920
#4 NIGHT ATTACK
